For cases like this in which axis drops labels that are too close 
together, I usually use mtext instead:

vect1 <- seq(1:40)
vect2 <- seq(51:90)
plot(vect1,vect2, axes = FALSE)
axis(side=1, at=vect1, labels = rep(" ", length(vect1)))
axis(side = 2)
mtext(side = 1, at = vect1, text = as.character(vect1), line = 1)
box()

But, as you can see, there is a reason why axis drops some of the labels.

Regards,
Sundar

