Many thanks to Bill Dunlap, Nick Ellis, Sundar Dorai-Raj, Tim Hesterberg and
Joseph S. Verducci for the assistance.

The solutions that seem to work the best were suggested by Bill Dunlap

whch <- which(temp!=0)
data.frame(
    one = as.numeric(dimnames(temp)[[1]][ row(temp)[whch] ]),
    two = as.numeric(dimnames(temp)[[2]][ col(temp)[whch] ])
        )

and Nick Ellis

data.frame(
one=dimnames(temp)[[1]][row(temp)[temp>0]],
two=dimnames(temp)[[2]][col(temp)[temp>0]]
)

Cheers

Mark Grant

