There may be functions to do this, but I'm not familiar with them.

I would use "brute force" something like the following:

          fa1 <- factanal(..., factors=1, ...)
          fa2 <- factanal(..., factors=2, ...)

          test.factor <- function(x1, x2){
            lglk1 <- x1$criteria
            lglk2 <- x2$criteria
            df1 <- x1$dof
            df2 <- x2$dof
            d.lglk <- (lglk2-lglk1)
            d.df <- (df2-df1)
            p.value <- (1-pchisq(d.lglk, d.df))
           #... organize the results in an ANOVA table
           # "aov.tbl"
            aov.tbl
          }

